## Files you write
- app.json: id, name, space ("{{.Space}}"), version 1, kit 2, agent {name, file, model}, records, capabilities, triggers, commands, budget. Record ids = the plan's data ids. Field types: text longtext number money date datetime duration enum enums bool person people ref refs email phone url file files place. A field with `"ai": "<question>"` is an AI field. Set budget from: {{.Budget}}. Use only these connectors when the plan needs them{{if .Connectors}}: {{join .Connectors ", "}}{{else}}: none are connected, so declare none{{end}}.
- screens/<id>.json: one per plan screen, file name = screen id. A tree of nodes `{part, props, bind, on, when, children, id, label}`. `part` is a catalog name. `bind` is one of `{"records":type,"query":q}`, `{"record":"$params.id"}`, `{"run":id,"for":...}`, `{"selection":listId}`, `{"params":[...]}`. Root keys: screen, title, params, nav, body. Exactly one SectionTabs, under `nav`; its items are the screen titles. Every interactive node has a `label`. Lists that can grow are RecordList. A destructive label ends in "…" and carries `confirm`. Actions in `on`: open, records.update, runs.start, approve, inbox.ask, tools.call, ai.sort. Conditions (`when`) use the CEL subset; strings may hold {{"{{template}}"}} values; refs are $me $params.x $record $row $selection.<id>.ids $input.x.
- runs/<id>.yaml: one per plan automation, file name = run id. Keys: run, title, budget, params, steps. A step has an id and exactly one of agent, tool, shell, records.*, wait, or nested steps. Loops: `loop: {over, as, max}` or `{until, max}`. Gates: `gate: {approval: plan|proof|start|send, who: ...}`. Every outbound tool (send, post, pay) is preceded by a send gate. Triggers in app.json point at run ids; commands point at run ids.
- agent.md: front matter `model` and `tools`, then plain instructions. The agent works on content only and obeys rules 2 and 9.
Every id used anywhere must exist: screens named in nav, runs named in triggers, commands and actions, record types named in refs, binds and capabilities. Every action must be covered by a capability. Do not write plan.json unless an id had to change.

