## Output
Reply with one JSON object `{"<path>": <content>, ...}` and nothing else: no code fence, no prose before or after. Paths are exactly app.json, screens/<id>.json, runs/<id>.yaml, agent.md (and plan.json only if changed). For .json files the content is the JSON object itself; for .yaml and .md files it is a string with newlines escaped. Strict JSON throughout.
